      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted">Problem: card-testing and velocity attacks arrive in bursts across many merchants, and tightening limits blocks genuine shoppers.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm">What we do: evaluate every payment in real time against velocity and device rules, and replay a new limit against history before it ships.</p>
